@startuml
!include ../../drawio-theme.puml
skinparam defaultFontName "Hiragino Sans GB"
skinparam linetype polyline
title Session sub-session 协调边界（候选，待实现）
top to bottom direction

class "外部业务处理器" as Business <<external_subdomain>>
interface "SessionForkJoinPort\nFork / Cancel / Query" as RelationPort <<inbound_port>>
package "SessionManager" {
  class "SubSessionCoordinator" as Relations <<application_service>>
  class "JoinBarrier + JoinMember" as Barrier <<aggregate_root>>
  interface "JoinRepository\ninbox / barrier / reduction / outbox" as Journal <<outbound_port>>
  class "ReducerRegistry" as Reducer <<domain_service>>
  RelationPort <|.. Relations
  Relations --> Barrier : 策略裁决 / 状态迁移
  Relations --> Journal : 唯一持久协调与恢复进度
  Relations --> Reducer : 事务外规约
}
interface "FlowRunCommandPort\nsubmit / cancel / resume" as FlowPort <<outbound_port>>
class "FlowEngine\n单 Flow 执行" as Engine <<external_subdomain>>
class "安全模块\nPDP / PEP / Permit" as Security <<external_subdomain>>
class "Session / Artifact Store" as Session <<external_subdomain>>

Business --> RelationPort : 提交冻结ForkSpec
Relations --> Security : 委派与数据授权
Relations --> Session : branch / snapshot / append Summary
Relations --> FlowPort : commit后outbox
FlowPort --> Engine : 执行/取消Child，唤醒Parent
Engine ..> Relations : 终态事件 -> inbox

note bottom of Relations
  统一拥有Session血缘、Fork/Join/Reduce、取消编排与Parent唤醒。
  inbox/member/barrier CAS防重复决策；Reduce不持DB锁。
  Parent Summary提交确认后才产生resume outbox。
end note

note bottom of Engine
  FE只记单Flow执行事实和幂等指令回执。
  不读JoinBarrier、Reducer或Child黑板。
end note
@enduml
